WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
[CLICK]

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.704
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.055 --> 00:00:05.680
ROSS DUFFER: We're
the Duffer Brothers.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.910
We're the writers,
creators, directors,

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.123
producers of the Netflix
series "Stranger Things."

00:00:11.123 --> 00:00:13.590
[CRUNCHING]

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:17.820
In this class, we'll use
examples from "Stranger Things"

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.723
and show you documents we've
never shown anyone ever before.

00:00:20.723 --> 00:00:22.140
MATT DUFFER: You're
going to learn

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.110
how to develop a television
show, how to take it

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:29.100
from the seed of an idea to
an outline into a script,

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.650
and ultimately how
you sell that script.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.260
ROSS DUFFER: We actually got
rejected at least 12 times

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:35.557
before we finally sold it.

00:00:35.557 --> 00:00:37.140
MATT DUFFER: In real
time, we're going

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
to develop an unofficial
Dustin-Steve "Stranger Things"

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.310
spinoff idea.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:44.490
This is not a real
thing, Netflix.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.680
How about they find that
Dustin's dad is missing

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:50.010
and has been missing
for many years?

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.150
[LAUGHS]

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.210
 Many, many months.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:53.012
 Many months.

00:00:53.012 --> 00:00:54.720
MATT DUFFER: This
class is for the person

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.512
who dreams of telling
stories for a living.

00:00:56.512 --> 00:00:59.610
It's everything we wish
someone had come and told us.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:03.737
We think it can give you an
idea of how to get from A to B.

00:01:03.737 --> 00:01:05.820
ROSS DUFFER: Yeah, I still
think it's pretty cool.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:06.390
 All right.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:07.410
 The lizard creature.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.250
 Huh.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.792
 We'll see what
the internet thinks.

00:01:09.792 --> 00:01:11.510
 [LAUGHS]

